<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41013" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστέφ-ω</span></b> , in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> always in 
			Med.
		, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρητῆρας ἐπεστέψαντο</span>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτοῖο</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>filled</i> them with wine,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.470
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.148
			</span></i>, etc. (variously expld., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.13d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.674e
			</span></i>, and 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκστέφω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>to be
				full</i>
			<i>of</i> or <i>covered with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεσδαι μακωνίδων ἄρτων ἐπιστέφοισαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcm.
					74
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοὰς ἐ. τινί</span>
			<i>pour</i> libations <i>as an honour to</i> the dead, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				441
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>. 
				Med.
			, <i>wreathe</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθεϊ χαίτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					47.11
				</span></i>
			:—also in 
				Act.
			, <i>crown, surround</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύμασι
				Παταλήνην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				27.158
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
